  "title": "逛街買東西",
  "titleEn": "Shopping",
  "minutes": 12,
  "summary": "學會問價錢、問尺寸、試穿和決定購買。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "這一課學什麼",
      "body": [
        "買東西時最常用的四句話：多少錢、有沒有別的尺寸、可以試穿嗎、我要買這個。",
        "另外要特別注意數字：13 和 30、14 和 40 聽起來很像，這一課會練習分辨。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "title": "聽聽看這段對話",
      "scene": "場景：在服飾店",
      "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-2/dialogue.mp3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "店員",
          "side": "left",
          "en": "Hi, can I help you?",
          "zh": "你好，需要幫忙嗎？",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-2/d1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "你",
          "side": "right",
          "en": "Yes. How much is this jacket?",
          "zh": "是的，這件外套多少錢？",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-2/d2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "店員",
          "side": "left",
          "en": "It's forty dollars.",
          "zh": "四十美元。",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-2/d3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "你",
          "side": "right",
          "en": "Do you have it in a smaller size?",
          "zh": "有小一點的尺寸嗎？",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-2/d4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "店員",
          "side": "left",
          "en": "Yes, here you are.",
          "zh": "有的，給你。",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-2/d5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "你",
          "side": "right",
          "en": "Can I try it on?",
          "zh": "我可以試穿嗎？",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-2/d6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "店員",
          "side": "left",
          "en": "Sure. The fitting room is over there.",
          "zh": "當然，試衣間在那邊。",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-2/d7.mp3"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "你",
          "side": "right",
          "en": "It fits well. I'll take it.",
          "zh": "很合身，我要買這件。",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/life-2/d8.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
